11.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">巧克力</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">：PVP水队<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">奶</span>，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">无环境</span>，不抽。<span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556231085_36552684.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556231085_36552684.png\" style=\"width: 223px; height: 200px;\"></div></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">②<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">火Raid</span>-劳菲Raid</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\">本体：</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611553774492_63777895.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611553774492_63777895.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">劳菲（火眼镜）：</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">PVP生命链接<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">奶</span>（ss=海王星ds）恶心人有一手，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">娱乐用的玩具角色</span>，不抽。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">对策：</span><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611553982495_54502157.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611553982495_54502157.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; width: 80px; height: 80px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">毕鲁巴（星爆初音/青钢影）<span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">：</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">普通Raid对策<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">水刀</span>，原生3连，点火4连，没集中，没弱点增幅伤害，<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">被点火6连水刀完爆</span>，不抽。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">（除非国际服加强）</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\">3月总结：省钱</span><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\">所以各位可以尽情梭哈女仆猫。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">附上壁纸方便各位xp抽卡：</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556168403_91056919.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556168403_91056919.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556175141_15617131.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556175141_15617131.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556179248_74298103.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556179248_74298103.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">Raid皮肤：</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556183533_46935445.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611556183533_46935445.png\"></div></span><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">后续日历预测：</span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">Raid剧情已经到劳菲，后面已知</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240); font-weight: bold;\">主线Raid有</span></div></span></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554721005_19150033.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554721005_19150033.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(215, 171, 81);\">赛特-光Raid</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554726946_9656046.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554726946_9656046.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">阿罗汉-暗Raid</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554760974_81657461.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554760974_81657461.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\">卡拉拉特里-火Raid</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">支线Raid有</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554932687_15713328.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611554932687_15713328.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(215, 171, 81);\">朱诺-光Raid</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">故<span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">极大概率出现2个连</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">续的光Raid</span>，各位可以尽早开始准备暗刀</span>。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;\">WB方面则是</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611555126023_76463642.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611555126023_76463642.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">玛土撒拉-水WB</span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611555209294_21268961.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611555209294_21268961.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(215, 171, 81);\">底波拉-光WB</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">先后顺序打乱的可能性很小，提前准备好木刀，木辅助。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">翻牌方面：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1613621285658_83489712.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1613621285658_83489712.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">莱玛&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">暗队加速辅 特点是提升减益回避率。&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">整体偏弱 不抽</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（实装莱玛代表策划决定补旧卡翻牌，即轮子在5月有大概率实装）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1613621289070_27985644.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1613621289070_27985644.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">莱佛士</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 木队不死盾 娱乐向的玩具角色&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">整体偏弱 不抽</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center; \"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">（实装莱佛士则是正常翻牌进度，作为鲁邦前置翻牌剧情出现，即鲁邦确定在5/6月实装）</span></div><br></span></span></div></span></div></span><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">&nbsp;\n\n</div></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num